# .env is tracked on purpose: Lovable's build reads the VITE_ Supabase URL and
# publishable key from it, and the published site cannot reach the database
# without it. It must hold nothing else. This repo is public: anything secret
# (service-role key, app secrets, provider keys) goes in Lovable Cloud env vars,
# or in a local-only file below.
.env.local
.env.*.local
.dev.vars
